---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`Privacy Policy / 隐私政策 — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="Privacy policy: 100% client-side data privacy, zero tracking of tool inputs, anonymous analytics, and Google AdSense compliance."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="privacy-main">
			<!-- ENGLISH VERSION -->
			<div class="i18n-en">
				<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
				<p class="updated">Last updated: September 5, 2026</p>

				<div class="privacy-highlight">
					<strong>Summary</strong>: Your privacy is our highest priority. All tool calculations and formatting run entirely in your local browser. We never collect, store, or transmit what you type into our utilities.
				</div>

				<h2>1. Your Tool Inputs Stay 100% Local</h2>
				<p>
					Every single tool on this site — including financial calculators (mortgage, IRR, income tax), developer formatters (JSON, SQL, HTML, CSS, XML), decoders (JWT, Base64), unit converters, the QR code maker, and Markdown previewer —
					<strong>executes strictly inside your browser's local JavaScript environment</strong>.
				</p>
				<p>
					The values, code snippets, tokens, and numbers you enter are processed directly on your device and are
					<strong>never transmitted, stored, inspected, or logged</strong> on any server. You can verify this anytime by inspecting your browser's Network tab (F12) while using any tool.
				</p>

				<h2>2. Web Analytics</h2>
				<p>
					This site uses <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> to measure overall site traffic. This service is designed to be privacy-first:
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>It operates completely <strong>without cookies or local storage</strong>.</li>
					<li>It does not collect personal identifiers, IP addresses, or visitor fingerprints.</li>
					<li>It provides only aggregated, anonymous counts of page views to help us understand which tools are useful.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>3. Advertising & Cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
				<p>
					To keep all tools free and cover server/CDN operating expenses, this site may display non-intrusive advertisements served by <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
				</p>
				<p>
					Google and its advertising partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites:
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting
						<a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.
					</li>
					<li>
						Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendor cookies for personalized advertising by visiting
						<a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.
					</li>
					<li>
						For details on how Google handles advertising data, consult
						<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Advertising Policies</a>.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>4. Your Rights (GDPR & CCPA)</h2>
				<p>
					Under the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (<strong>GDPR</strong>) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (<strong>CCPA</strong>):
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						Because we do not collect personal identifiers, account data, or tool contents, we do not maintain personal databases to access, rectify, or delete.
					</li>
					<li>
						We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties.
					</li>
					<li>
						Where required by applicable law in the EEA, UK, or California, appropriate consent mechanisms and opt-out options are respected.
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>5. Hosting & Infrastructure</h2>
				<p>
					This site is statically hosted via GitHub Pages and distributed globally through Cloudflare Edge CDN. The hosting infrastructure records standard HTTP server request logs (such as request timestamps and HTTP status codes) solely for DDoS defense, system security, and operational reliability, in accordance with
					<a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a>.
				</p>

				<h2>6. Policy Updates & Contact</h2>
				<p>
					We may occasionally update this Privacy Policy to reflect technical or legal requirements. Any modifications will be posted here with an updated date.
				</p>
				<p>
					If you have questions about this privacy statement, please contact us via email at
					<a href="mailto:admin@qcsunny.org">admin@qcsunny.org</a>
					or submit an issue on our
					<a href="https://github.com/qcsunny/qcsunny.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub repository</a>.
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- CHINESE VERSION -->
			<div class="i18n-zh">
				<h1>隐私政策</h1>
				<p class="updated">最近更新时间：2026年9月5日</p>

				<div class="privacy-highlight">
					<strong>核心承诺</strong>：您的数据与隐私安全是我们的首要原则。本站所有在线工具均在你的浏览器本地离线运行，绝不收集、绝不上报、绝不存储您在工具中输入的任何代码与数据。
				</div>

				<h2>1. 工具输入数据 100% 浏览器本地运算</h2>
				<p>
					本站提供的所有实用工具——包括金融计算器（房贷计算、提前还款、IRR 计算、个税计算）、开发者代码工具（JSON、SQL、HTML、CSS、XML 格式化美化）、编解码工具（JWT、Base64）、单位转换、二维码生成与 Markdown 实时预览编辑器——
					<strong>均在您的浏览器本地 JavaScript 运行时中纯客户端执行</strong>。
				</p>
				<p>
					您所输入的数值、代码片段、鉴权 Token、财务数据和文档内容仅在您的本地设备上进行运算，
					<strong>绝不会向任何服务器发送、存储、监控或记录</strong>。您可以在使用任意工具时随时按 <kbd>F12</kbd> 打开浏览器的“网络 (Network)”面板进行全面自主抓包验证。
				</p>

				<h2>2. 访问统计与无隐私跟踪</h2>
				<p>
					本站采用 <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> 进行基础的站点访问量聚合统计。该统计方案秉持严格的隐私保护标准：
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>完全 <strong>无需使用任何 Cookie 或本地存储</strong>；</li>
					<li>不收集任何用户个人身份信息、IP 地址或设备硬件指纹；</li>
					<li>仅统计匿名的汇总页面浏览量（PV），用于评估哪些工具对用户最有帮助。</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>3. 广告投放与第三方 Cookie (Google AdSense)</h2>
				<p>
					为了维持网站与 CDN 基础设施的高速稳定运营，并长期保持所有工具免费开放，本站可能展示由 <strong>Google AdSense</strong> 投放的非侵入式广告。
				</p>
				<p>
					Google 及其广告合作伙伴可能会使用 Cookie，以便根据您先前访问本站或其他网站的记录投放相关广告：
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						您可以随时前往
						<a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google 广告设置中心</a>
						管理或选择停用个性化广告；
					</li>
					<li>
						您也可以通过访问
						<a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>
						停用部分第三方广告供应商的个性化 Cookie；
					</li>
					<li>
						如需深入了解 Google 如何在投放广告时使用相关数据，请参阅
						<a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google 广告技术与隐私说明</a>。
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>4. 用户权利保护 (GDPR 与 CCPA)</h2>
				<p>
					依据欧盟《通用数据保护条例》(<strong>GDPR</strong>) 以及美国加利福尼亚州《消费者隐私法案》(<strong>CCPA</strong>) 的要求：
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>
						由于本站不留存任何用户个人数据或工具输入记录，因此不存在需要查询、导出或删除的个人数据中心；
					</li>
					<li>
						我们绝不会出售、出租或交易任何用户的个人信息；
					</li>
					<li>
						对于相关受管辖地区的访问者，本站完全遵从个性化广告的选择与停用权限。
					</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>5. 基础设施与静态托管</h2>
				<p>
					本站采用静态页面架构，托管于 GitHub Pages，并通过 Cloudflare 全球边缘 CDN 进行加速。底层网络基础设施仅在网络协议层面记录基础的服务器访问日志（如时间戳和 HTTP 状态码），以用于防范网络攻击（DDoS）并确保系统安全稳定，详细规则遵循
					<a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub 隐私声明</a>。
				</p>

				<h2>6. 政策更新与联系方式</h2>
				<p>
					我们可能会根据法律法规或技术更新适时调整本隐私政策。政策的任何变动均会在此页面公布并标注更新日期。
				</p>
				<p>
					如对本隐私政策有任何疑问、建议或意见，欢迎通过电子邮箱联系我们：
					<a href="mailto:admin@qcsunny.org">admin@qcsunny.org</a>，
					或前往本站
					<a href="https://github.com/qcsunny/qcsunny.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub 仓库提交 Issue</a>。
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />

		<script is:inline>
			(() => {
				const titles = {
					en: 'Privacy Policy — QCSunny Lab',
					zh: '隐私政策 — QCSunny Lab'
				};
				function syncTitle(lang) {
					document.title = titles[lang] || titles.zh;
				}
				const cur = document.documentElement.dataset.lang || localStorage.getItem('site:lang') || 'zh';
				syncTitle(cur);
				window.addEventListener('site:lang-change', (e) => {
					syncTitle(e.detail);
				});
			})();
		</script>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.privacy-main {
		/* same fix as about.astro: the old `max-width: min(46rem, …)` sat above
		   global.css's `main { width: 720px }` and so never applied. */
		width: min(var(--w-prose), 100% - 2.5rem);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.5rem 0 4rem;
		/* 18px, matching about.astro and blog posts; see --w-prose in global.css */
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--fg);
	}
	h1 {
		color: var(--fg);
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.3rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		margin-bottom: 0.2em;
	}
	.updated {
		color: var(--dim);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.6em;
	}
	.privacy-highlight {
		background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08);
		border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 2em;
		font-size: 0.98rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.privacy-highlight strong {
		color: #059669;
	}
	html[data-theme='dark'] .privacy-highlight strong {
		color: #34d399;
	}
	h2 {
		color: var(--fg);
		font-size: 1.3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-top: 2em;
		margin-bottom: 0.7em;
		padding-bottom: 0.3em;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gridline);
	}
	p {
		margin-bottom: 1em;
	}
	ul {
		padding-left: 1.4rem;
		margin: 0.8em 0 1.4em;
	}
	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.6em;
		line-height: 1.65;
	}
	a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}
	a:hover {
		opacity: 0.85;
	}
	kbd {
		display: inline-block;
		font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
		font-size: 0.82em;
		padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
		background: var(--bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--gridline);
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: var(--dim);
	}
</style>
